                <pb facs="0667" n="1345" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1345"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Chase.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-07-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 3, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit herewith, for
                    your information, a despatch (No. 39) received from the United States consul at
                    Nassau, which I will thank you to return with your reply.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. S. P. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chase</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary of the Treasury.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
